Subject: [PATCH 1/2] freedreno/fdl: Expose UBWC height

We will need this for clears operating directly on UBWC.
---
 src/freedreno/fdl/fd6_layout.c       | 6 +++---
 src/freedreno/fdl/freedreno_layout.h | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

